        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "What's changed compared with before?",
            "translation_fa": "نسبت به قبل چی تغییر کرده؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "I've noticed that my wellbeing depends more on a consistent routine than on occasional big changes.",
            "translation_fa": "متوجه شدم حال خوبم بیشتر به روال منظم بستگی داره تا تغییرهای بزرگ گهگاهی."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "And what effect has that had?",
            "translation_fa": "و این چه اثری داشته؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "When work gets busy, stress affects my sleep before I notice any other sign.",
            "translation_fa": "وقتی کار شلوغ می‌شه، استرس قبل از هر نشونه دیگه روی خوابم اثر می‌ذاره."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
